  "variants": {
    "abstract": "Original MCabs.tla and MCabs.cfg. The old and new revisions differ only in the quantified smallest-term assumption. Three model-value servers, three integer terms, MaxExtend=3. Symmetry, constraint, invariants NoConflicts and TypeOK and step property AppendOnlyProp retained.",
    "small": "Change only MaxExtend == 3 to MaxExtend == 1 in MCabs.tla.",
    "grow": "Change only MaxExtend == 3 to MaxExtend == 4 in MCabs.tla. The retained length constraint remains Len(cLogs[i]) <= 7.",
    "prevote": "Unmodified MCccfraft.tla and .cfg before and after the move to pre-vote timeout elections. The upstream tlc.py mc defaults set RAFT_CONFIGS=1C2N, TERM_COUNT=0, REQUEST_COUNT=3 and DISABLE_CHECK_QUORUM=true. This setting completed with equal graphs for the two revisions. It need not expose every behavior changed by pre-vote.",
    "direct": "In both abstract action generators replace membership of primed cLogs in [Servers -> Seq(Terms)] by checks on DOMAIN cLogs and i, membership of every frozen old value in Seq(Terms), and existential over one v in Seq(Terms) assigning the EXCEPT update. All original remaining action conjuncts retained.",
    "module": "Add FramedFunctions to abs.tla EXTENDS; replace only the same two occurrences with primed cLogs in FramedFunctions(Servers, Seq(Terms), cLogs, {i}). The ordinary checkers resolve the new module from the model folder."
  },
